SELECT sift.scope_create('facts_by_scope', 'facts', 'dim_a_id', 'pairs', 'scope_id') AS copy_rows;
NOTICE:  sift_col index "facts_by_scope_col": 4 automatic choices, 1 advice
DETAIL:  advice: track_changes = the table has no one-column primary key; key_order = scope_id, created_at;
rollup_columns = scope_id, note; order_array_columns = created_at; and 1 more
HINT:  Reasons, costs and how to turn each off: SELECT * FROM sift.index_choices('facts_by_scope_col');
